          "value": "<p>The thrall is a citizen of Toad Town under there. A creature within 5 feet can use an action to pry the fused helm loose with a successful DC 15 Strength (Athletics) or Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) check, with advantage if the thrall is grappled, restrained or incapacitated. When the helm comes off the thrall falls prone and is incapacitated for 1 minute, then wakes as a commoner with no memory of the vats and the vines wither over the following day. Reducing the thrall to 0 hit points kills the citizen; a creature that chooses to knock it out instead may do so.</p>",
